# Solution

The compared theorem `PLaplacian.pharmonious_exists_converge`, stated in
`Challenge.lean`, is proved in the library, in
`Plaplacian/DirichletExistence.lean`, from the existence theorem
`PLaplacian.exists_pharmonious` and the convergence theorem
`PLaplacian.pharmonious_converge`. Importing the library brings it, and the
definitions it uses, into this environment, where Comparator checks them
against the Challenge.
